{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S02、S04、S10等段的感受词仍偏密，且“童年时初恋的下午”“情色的暖意”等意象有时替观众解释得过满；X的叙事因果更完整，也更克制。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的纵向交替、关键词突出和按音乐段落出现的感受提示，让观众更容易抓住主线，不必在左右两栏之间反复寻找对应关系；水面、船身、摇荡到停定的意象也形成了贯穿始终的感官线索。X在人物动机上解释得更完整，尤其是害怕给对方负担、想把眼下的美好留久一点等心理因果，Y压缩后略有损失；但整体扫读效率、重点识别和听觉感受的细腻程度，Y更胜一筹。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "02f4d452-5612-489e-8d06-0b354cf1063e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T062633166396Z", "elapsed_seconds": 111.094, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T06:28:24.259266+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d85ed3ca61325c90d18762e80c1ab205c6d062dce380c77440e65c1868018975", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we